(5890, 81, 'MOUNTAIN PROVINCE', NULL, 'Cordillera Administrative Region', 'PARACELIS', 'Bantay\nButigue', 'CONSTRUCTION OF BUTIGUE WATER SYSTEM', '2014', 'PW', 'PW-14-14-44-06-000-1', 'The project covers the construction of water system in Butigue.In Butigue,Butigue had been suffering from lack of water supply. Residents get their water from shallow wells, or fetch water from riverbanks using private vehicles. The project intends to construct level II or Spring Development. Its aims is to improve health and water supply problem in the community. The water source is located at the southern part of Barangay Butigue which is 1.6 km away from the service area. For Daggason,The project intends to serve a population of 4483 as direct and indirect beneficiaries. Majority of which belongs to the Gaddang Tribe. Aside from providing water supply in the community it also aims to provide supply water for bio intensive gardening intended as additional source of food and livelihood. The spring source is located at northern part of Barangay Bantay in Mount Banog whose distance is about .8 km from source to service area.', 'Water Supply and Sanitation', '2026-04-22', 2100000.00, 0.00, 1559, 'No', '2015-04-10', 'admin', 'Municipal LGU', '2015-02-02', '2015-02-24', '2015-03-13', '2015-04-10', 'KALINGA BUILDERS', 2405975.73, '69', '2026-04-22', '2015-06-21', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-22 09:21:27', '2026-04-22 09:21:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5891, 81, 'MOUNTAIN PROVINCE', NULL, 'Cordillera Administrative Region', 'SAGADA', 'Balugan\nPide\nNacagang\nSuyo\nTaccong', 'Potable Water Supply System', '2014', 'PW', 'PW-14-14-44-09-000-1', 'This project intends to provide water supply to six (6) Barangays. Its aim is to Provide ample and quality water supply to 288 households from the prevailing 28 liters per day per capita to the standard 60 l/d/c;.Reduce water-borne diseases and the corresponding health care cost by 90% through the provision of clean water.To increase water output by 80% through construction of two (2) water reservoir.', 'Water Supply and Sanitation', '2026-04-22', 1500000.00, 0.00, 288, 'No', '2026-04-22', 'admin', 'Municipal LGU', '2026-04-22', '2026-04-22', '2026-04-22', '2026-04-22', 'N/A', 1500000.00, '0', '2026-04-22', '2026-04-22', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-22 09:21:27', '2026-04-22 09:21:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
